{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Trigger Keeper 是一款以聲控快門為核心的拍攝工具，適閤家庭聚會、團體合照、單人創作，以及雙手正忙於維修或工作時使用。用戶可自訂觸發詞，說出後即由 iPhone 拍照；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-72.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>聲控快門與微笑拍攝</h2>\n<p>自訂觸發詞後開始聆聽，說出詞語即以閃光燈提示並啟動快門；亦可開啟微笑拍攝，全員微笑時自動拍照。程式支援連拍三張、Live Photo、0.5x 至 6x 變焦及多種取景比例，音量鍵與 Camera Control 可作手動快門。語音辨識與微笑偵測全在 iPhone 本地運行，不含網絡連線程式碼，亦不需帳戶、廣告或分析；聆聽會在手動停止、離開 App 或連續安靜 10 分鐘後結束。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-93-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-94-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-95-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-96-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-97-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-98-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Trigger Keeper</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/trigger-keeper/id6774868117?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:41:44.455676+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":368,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T12:35:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T00:18:21.125376+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:38:21.434700+00:00","content_hash":"2cab34c8eb4726b65c9d82f9fb48936e8b9c0d733a85299c4436077131af616a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}